<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Tally Sikho - Bacchon ki Book</title>
    <!-- Font Awesome for Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0-beta3/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #f0f7ff 0%, #e6f0fa 100%);
            padding: 20px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .book-container {
            max-width: 1100px;
            width: 100%;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 40px 40px 20px 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -8px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
            padding: 30px 30px 40px;
            position: relative;
            border: 2px solid #2a6f97;
        }

        /* Book Header */
        .book-header {
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: 6px solid #ffb347;
            padding-bottom: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .book-header h1 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            color: #1a3e60;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 15px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .book-header h1 i {
            color: #ff8c00;
            font-size: 2.8rem;
        }

        .book-header .sub {
            background: #1a3e60;
            color: white;
            padding: 10px 25px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            display: inline-block;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            margin-top: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #0e2a40;
        }

        .page-number {
            position: absolute;
            right: 10px;
            bottom: 10px;
            color: #b0c7d9;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        /* Cards / Pages */
        .page {
            background: #f9fcff;
            border-radius: 30px;
            padding: 25px 25px 20px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 0 #cbdae6, 0 12px 28px -8px rgba(0,20,40,0.15);
            border-left: 8px solid #2a6f97;
            transition: 0.2s;
        }

        .page:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 0 #b0c7db, 0 18px 35px -8px rgba(0,20,40,0.2);
        }

        .page-title {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #0b2b44;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            background: #d9e9f7;
            padding: 8px 20px;
            border-radius: 60px;
        }

        .page-title i {
            background: #0b2b44;
            color: white;
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 60px;
            width: 55px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
        }

        .grid-2 {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 30px;
            margin: 20px 0 10px;
        }

        .grid-3 {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr);
            gap: 20px;
            margin: 20px 0 10px;
        }

        .diagram-box {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 20px 15px;
            box-shadow: inset 0 -4px 0 #c9dbe9, 0 6px 14px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
            border: 1px solid #d7e3ee;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .diagram-box i {
            font-size: 3.8rem;
            color: #1f6390;
            background: #e3effa;
            padding: 18px;
            border-radius: 60px;
            width: 90px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .diagram-box h3 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: #003153;
            margin: 12px 0 8px;
        }

        .diagram-box p {
            color: #1d3b57;
            font-size: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            text-align: left;
            padding: 0 6px;
        }

        .highlight {
            background: #fef3d6;
            border-left: 6px solid #f7b731;
            padding: 14px 20px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            margin: 18px 0 5px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .voucher-row {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 18px;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }

        .voucher-item {
            background: #e7f0fa;
            padding: 12px 20px;
            border-radius: 60px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #003b66;
            border: 2px dashed #2f7ca3;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        .voucher-item i {
            color: #cb6e0e;
        }

        .compare {
            background: #e3edf6;
            border-radius: 28px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 20px 0 10px;
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: space-around;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .compare div {
            background: white;
            padding: 18px 22px;
            border-radius: 28px;
            flex: 1 1 180px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #b8ccdd;
        }

        .compare div i {
            font-size: 2.4rem;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .big-icon {
            font-size: 4rem;
            color: #11507a;
        }

        hr {
            margin: 20px 0;
            border: 2px dotted #b6cee2;
        }

        .footer-book {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 30px;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: #1e4a6b;
            background: #d4e4f2;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 60px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 800px) {
            .grid-2, .grid-3 {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            .book-header h1 {
                font-size: 2.2rem;
            }
            .page-title {
                font-size: 1.6rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="book-container">

    <!-- Book Cover / Header -->
    <div class="book-header">
        <h1>
            <i class="fas fa-book-open"></i> 
            Tally की दुनिया 
            <i class="fas fa-calculator"></i>
        </h1>
        <div class="sub"><i class="fas fa-child"></i> बच्चों के लिए चित्रों के साथ  <i class="fas fa-pencil-alt"></i></div>
        <span class="page-number">📖 पेज 1</span>
    </div>

    <!-- ========== PAGE 1: BASIC ========== -->
    <div class="page">
        <div class="page-title">
            <i class="fas fa-seedling"></i> 
            Tally क्या है ? (Basic)
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px; align-items: center;">
            <div style="flex: 1.5; min-width: 200px;">
                <p style="font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.8;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color:#1f7a3d;"></i> 
                <strong>Tally</strong> एक <strong>computer software</strong> है जो दुकान या कंपनी का <strong>पूरा हिसाब-किताब</strong> रखता है।</p>
                <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; background: #dff0fa; padding: 14px; border-radius: 30px; margin-top: 12px;">
                <i class="fas fa-rupee-sign"></i> कितना पैसा आया, कितना गया, और कितना profit/loss — सब Tally में !
                </p>
            </div>
            <div style="flex:1; text-align: center; background: #e2effa; padding: 20px; border-radius: 60px;">
                <i class="fas fa-laptop" style="font-size: 5rem; color: #005a8c;"></i>
                <i class="fas fa-arrow-right" style="font-size: 2rem; color: #d4830e;"></i>
                <i class="fas fa-chart-pie" style="font-size: 4rem; color: #1f7a3d;"></i>
                <div style="font-weight: bold;">कंप्यूटर → Tally → Report</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="highlight">
            <i class="fas fa-lightbulb" style="color:#ca6d0b;"></i> 
            <strong>सबसे पहला काम :</strong> Tally में अपनी दुकान / firm के नाम से <strong>Company बनाना</strong> | 
            <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i> फिर Ledger, Voucher, और Tax entries.
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ========== PAGE 2: COMPANY & LEDGER ========== -->
    <div class="page">
        <div class="page-title">
            <i class="fas fa-building"></i> 
            Company & Ledger (खाते)
        </div>
        <div class="grid-2">
            <div class="diagram-box">
                <i class="fas fa-user-plus"></i>
                <h3>1. Company Creation</h3>
                <p><i class="fas fa-chevron-circle-right"></i> Tally में <strong>Create Company</strong> पर क्लिक करें।</p>
                <p><i class="fas fa-chevron-circle-right"></i> नाम, Address, Financial year (जैसे 2025-26) डालें।</p>
                <p><i class="fas fa-chevron-circle-right"></i> <span style="background: #ffe5b4; padding: 3px 12px; border-radius: 40px;">Save</span> → आपकी कंपनी तैयार!</p>
                <div style="background: #cde0ef; border-radius: 60px; padding: 10px; margin-top: 10px;">
                    <i class="fas fa-folder-open"></i> जैसे: "मोहन की किराना दुकान"
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="diagram-box">
                <i class="fas fa-address-book"></i>
                <h3>2. Ledgers (Khate)</h3>
                <p><i class="fas fa-user"></i> <strong>Customer / Supplier</strong> — जैसे "रमेश", "अमेज़न सप्लायर"</p>
                <p><i class="fas fa-home"></i> <strong>Expenses</strong> — Rent, Electricity, Salary</p>
                <p><i class="fas fa-university"></i> <strong>Bank Account</strong> — SBI, PNB etc.</p>
                <div style="background: #cde0ef; border-radius: 60px; padding: 8px; margin-top: 6px;">
                    <i class="fas fa-plus-circle"></i> Tally में <strong>Ledger बनाना</strong> बहुत आसान है!
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align: center; background: #d3e4f2; border-radius: 40px; padding: 12px; margin-top: 10px;">
            <i class="fas fa-sync-alt"></i> Ledger = हर व्यक्ति / खाते का नाम जिससे हमारा लेन-देन होता है।
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ========== PAGE 3: VOUCHERS ========== -->
    <div class="page">
        <div class="page-title">
            <i class="fas fa-receipt"></i> 
            Vouchers (लेन-देन की Entry)
        </div>
        <p style="font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 12px;"><i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i> जब भी पैसा आता या जाता है, Tally में <strong>Voucher</strong> भरते हैं।</p>
        <div class="voucher-row">
            <span class="voucher-item"><i class="fas fa-hand-holding-usd"></i> Receipt (पैसा आया)</span>
            <span class="voucher-item"><i class="fas fa-hand-holding-heart"></i> Payment (पैसा गया)</span>
            <span class="voucher-item"><i class="fas fa-exchange-alt"></i> Contra (Bank से Cash / Cash to Bank)</span>
            <span class="voucher-item"><i class="fas fa-pen-fancy"></i> Journal (बिना Cash के adjustments)</span>
        </div>

        <div class="grid-3">
            <div class="diagram-box" style="background: #f2faff;">
                <i class="fas fa-arrow-down" style="color:#0e754b;"></i>
                <h4>Receipt</h4>
                <p>जब customer से पैसा मिले</p>
                <p><i class="fas fa-hand-holding-usd"></i> Debit: Cash / Bank <br> Credit: Customer</p>
            </div>
            <div class="diagram-box" style="background: #f2faff;">
                <i class="fas fa-arrow-up" style="color:#b1420e;"></i>
                <h4>Payment</h4>
                <p>जब supplier / बिल चुकाएं</p>
                <p><i class="fas fa-hand-holding-heart"></i> Debit: Supplier <br> Credit: Cash / Bank</p>
            </div>
            <div class="diagram-box" style="background: #f2faff;">
                <i class="fas fa-random" style="color:#2a5999;"></i>
                <h4>Contra</h4>
                <p>Bank से Cash निकाला या जमा किया</p>
                <p><i class="fas fa-university"></i> Debit: Cash <br> Credit: Bank (या उल्टा)</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="highlight">
            <i class="fas fa-info-circle"></i> <strong>Journal Voucher</strong> — जब कोई गलती सुधारनी हो या बिना पैसे के entry करनी हो (जैसे Depreciation).
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ========== PAGE 4: GST & TAX + EXCEL vs TALLY ========== -->
    <div class="page">
        <div class="page-title">
            <i class="fas fa-file-invoice-dollar"></i> 
            GST, Tax & Excel vs Tally
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 25px;">
            <div style="flex: 1; min-width: 180px; background: #e3eff8; border-radius: 30px; padding: 18px;">
                <i class="fas fa-percent" style="font-size: 3rem; color: #b47d0b;"></i>
                <h3>GST & Taxation</h3>
                <p><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color:#1b7940;"></i> Tally में <strong>GST bills</strong> बनाना आसान है।</p>
                <p><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color:#1b7940;"></i> खुद से <strong>GST Report</strong> बना देता है।</p>
                <p><i class="fas fa-file-alt"></i> जैसे: 5%, 12%, 18% GST वाले products</p>
            </div>
            <div style="flex: 1.5; min-width: 220px; background: #f3f9fe; border-radius: 30px; padding: 18px;">
                <i class="fas fa-balance-scale" style="font-size: 3rem; color: #0b5f7a;"></i>
                <h3>📊 Excel vs Tally</h3>
                <div class="compare">
                    <div><i class="fas fa-table" style="color:#217346;"></i> <strong>Excel</strong> <br> खाली register, हाथ से formula लगाओ</div>
                    <div><i class="fas fa-cog" style="color:#1f6390;"></i> <strong>Tally</strong> <br> Rules fixed, entry do — P&L, Balance Sheet, GST खुद बने</div>
                </div>
                <p style="margin-top: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-star" style="color: #d4a017;"></i> Tally = <strong>Automatic</strong> Reports, Excel = <strong>Manual</strong> work</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <hr>
        <div style="text-align: center; background: #d9e7f3; border-radius: 60px; padding: 16px;">
            <i class="fas fa-robot" style="font-size: 2.4rem;"></i>
            <strong>अब आपको बस Entry करनी है — Tally खुद Profit/Loss, Balance Sheet, GST सब बनाता है !</strong>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ========== PAGE 5: COMPLETE WORKFLOW (Diagram) ========== -->
    <div class="page">
        <div class="page-title">
            <i class="fas fa-project-diagram"></i> 
            पूरा काम (Complete Workflow)
        </div>
        <div style="background: #dcebf7; border-radius: 50px; padding: 25px 15px; text-align: center;">
            <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 20px; align-items: center;">
                <span style="background: #0b2b44; color: white; padding: 12px 20px; border-radius: 60px;"><i class="fas fa-building"></i> Company</span>
                <i class="fas fa-arrow-right" style="font-size: 2rem; color:#1f6390;"></i>
                <span style="background: #1f6390; color: white; padding: 12px 20px; border-radius: 60px;"><i class="fas fa-address-book"></i> Ledgers</span>
                <i class="fas fa-arrow-right" style="font-size: 2rem; color:#1f6390;"></i>
                <span style="background: #d4840e; color: white; padding: 12px 20px; border-radius: 60px;"><i class="fas fa-receipt"></i> Vouchers (Entry)</span>
                <i class="fas fa-arrow-right" style="font-size: 2rem; color:#1f6390;"></i>
                <span style="background: #1f7a3d; color: white; padding: 12px 20px; border-radius: 60px;"><i class="fas fa-chart-line"></i> Reports</span>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top: 25px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 15px;">
                <div style="background: white; border-radius: 30px; padding: 10px 22px;"><i class="fas fa-file-invoice"></i> Profit & Loss</div>
                <div style="background: white; border-radius: 30px; padding: 10px 22px;"><i class="fas fa-balance-sheet"></i> Balance Sheet</div>
                <div style="background: white; border-radius: 30px; padding: 10px 22px;"><i class="fas fa-file-pdf"></i> GST Returns</div>
                <div style="background: white; border-radius: 30px; padding: 10px 22px;"><i class="fas fa-chart-pie"></i> Ledger Summary</div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="highlight" style="margin-top: 20px;">
            <i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color:#1a7540;"></i> 
            <strong>बस इतना करना है :</strong> 
            1) Company बनाओ → 2) Ledger बनाओ → 3) Voucher entry करो → 4) Reports देखो और business समझो!
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Footer / End -->
    <div class="footer-book">
        <i class="fas fa-graduation-cap"></i> 
        अब आप Tally के Basic से Complete Work तक समझ गए ! 
        <i class="fas fa-smile" style="color: #d4840e;"></i> 
        <br><span style="font-size: 0.9rem; opacity: 0.9;"> हर बड़ा काम छोटी शुरुआत से होता है — अभ्यास करते रहो ! </span>
    </div>

</div>
</body>
</html>
